1
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:06,399
You called already?
Yes, Mom. What's up?

2
00:00:06,399 --> 00:00:11,080
Mom asked where you're staying.
Why, Mom?

3
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:15,360
Why aren't you answering?
And where did all the money in your account go?

4
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:20,400
You know Mom can check it, right?
But because Mom trusts you, she didn't question anything.

5
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,108
Mom is just confused…
So what exactly is going on with you and Kan?

6
00:00:25,333 --> 00:00:31,013
Today Kan went to the house to talk to your uncle.
Is it true—about you two?

7
00:00:31,013 --> 00:00:37,783
Mom… I'm sorry.
Will Mom be disgusted with me

8
00:00:37,783 --> 00:00:40,553
if I say that I love him?

9
00:00:40,553 --> 00:00:43,888
Earth, how could Mom ever hate you?

10
00:00:43,888 --> 00:00:46,511
I'm sorry… I'm sorry, Mom.

11
00:00:46,511 --> 00:00:52,439
Hey, don't cry. Mom knows it's hard.
If you keep worrying only about others' happiness,

12
00:00:52,439 --> 00:00:57,440
you won't ever be able
to smile from your heart.

13
00:01:03,359 --> 00:01:07,439
How was it?
What did Aunt Ae say?

14
00:01:07,439 --> 00:01:13,080
Nothing. Mom didn't say anything bad.
And…

15
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:17,726
You two are okay after that call, right?
Yeah, I talked to my mom.

16
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:23,079
- She accepted it—hey!
- Seriously, Earth?

17
00:01:23,079 --> 00:01:24,640
- Yeah.
- Really?

18
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:29,479
Earth…
Really, Earth?

19
00:01:29,479 --> 00:01:34,079
Hey—why would I lie?
